Let your personality and your genuine interests come through.

497
00:28:01,430 --> 00:28:07,210
And don't forget that business English piece practice, using the vocabulary specific to your industry.

498
00:28:07,790 --> 00:28:09,360
Adapt your communication style.

499
00:28:09,500 --> 00:28:12,820
Every feel has its own kind of language, its own expectations.

500
00:28:13,500 --> 00:28:15,800
Mastering that can make a huge difference.

501
00:28:15,780 --> 00:28:16,440
Absolutely.

