00:40:13,640 --> 00:40:16,530
I'm Rachel, the IT director here at TechSafe Solutions.

711
00:40:16,730 --> 00:40:17,490
Good morning, Rachel.

712
00:40:17,570 --> 00:40:19,380
Thank you so much for taking the time to meet with me today.

713
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,780
