882
00:52:04,860 --> 00:52:14,980
To differentiate in education means modifying your teaching methods, maybe your materials, even your assessments, to meet the diverse learning needs of individual students in your classroom.

883
00:52:15,480 --> 00:52:19,070
It's really about tailoring instruction to make sure every student can succeed.

