Conversely, for students who require additional support, I meticulously break down complex concepts into smaller, more manageable steps and utilize a variety of visual aids and graphic organizers.

941
00:56:04,350 --> 00:56:08,010
Furthermore, I consciously incorporate various learning styles into my lessons.

942
00:56:08,740 --> 00:56:16,650
Some students thrive with hands-on activities, while others learn more effectively through reading or auditory instruction, ensuring comprehensive accessibility.

943
00:56:17,010 --> 00:56:17,390
Excellent.

944
00:56:17,870 --> 00:56:19,150
