964
00:58:10,880 --> 00:58:18,110
My first action would be to listen very carefully and empathetically to the parents' concerns, ensuring I maintain a calm, non-defensive posture.

965
00:58:19,010 --> 00:58:28,520
I would then clearly and patiently explain my teaching methods and the specific grading criteria used, always referencing concrete examples of their child's work to illustrate my points.

966
00:58:29,260 --> 00:58:38,660
